		(property "Description" "BOOT button: momentary switch from GPIO0 (U3 pin 27) to GND. Pulling GPIO0 low at reset enters Joint Download Boot mode (Table 4-3, ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 Datasheet v1.8) for flashing over the native USB port (J3). Standard practice on ESP32-S3 dev boards. Generic 2-pin tactile switch (e.g. Panasonic EVQ-PUJ or C&K PTS645-series) -- pick exact footprint/PN at BOM time, same convention as this board's other generic connectors."
			(at 50 130 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
