		(property "Description" "GPIO3 (U3 pin 15) pull-down to GND, 10k. Espressif ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 Datasheet v1.8 Section 4.4 'JTAG Signal Source Control': 'The strapping pin GPIO3 ... does not have any internal pull resistors and the strapping value must be controlled by the external circuit that cannot be in a high impedance state.' Default eFuse JTAG-source config (Table 4-5, all-zero) ignores GPIO3 for source selection, so pull direction is not functionally critical yet, but an external pull is required by the datasheet's own text regardless."
			(at 175 90 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
