		(property "Description" "GPIO45 (U3 pin 26) pull-down to GND, 10k. Selects VDD3P3_RTC-derived 3.3V SPI-flash voltage per Espressif ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 Datasheet v1.8 Table 4-4 'VDD_SPI Voltage Control' (GPIO45=0 -> 3.3V via R_SPI, matching this module's standard 3.3V-flash variant, not the -N16R16VA 1.8V variant) -- matches GPIO45's own default weak-pull-down (Table 4-1), made explicit."
