		(property "Description" "GPIO46 (U3 pin 16) pull-down to GND, 10k. Espressif ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 Datasheet v1.8 Table 4-1 default is weak-pull-down; the combination GPIO46=1 with GPIO0=0 is explicitly called out by Espressif as invalid/may trigger unexpected behavior, so GPIO46 is pulled down to guarantee a valid boot-mode strap combination alongside R18/SW1."
